This project is not an official release of Lunar Calendar by Nei.
The earlier fork has been archived separately; its UI and backend adapters
are not included in this distribution.

Functional reference (not bundled extension code):
Lunar Calendar by Ailin Nemui / Nei, published version 54.
https://extensions.gnome.org/extension/675/lunar-calendar/
Historical archive identification is retained in upstream.lock.json.

Bundled third-party astronomy code and data:
ChineseCalendar by ytliu0, integration snapshot Nei/ChineseCalendar 20250205.
https://github.com/ytliu0/ChineseCalendar
https://gitlab.gnome.org/Nei/ChineseCalendar
GPL-3.0; included under src/vendor/ChineseCalendar, including COPYING.
The files were adapted to explicit ESM imports/exports in the earlier project;
this rewrite leaves that dependency unchanged. It is not claimed as our own work.

Native calendar/layout test fixtures are excerpts of GNOME Shell calendar.js and dateMenu.js,
versions 43.9, 48.0 and 51.1, from the GNOME Project, GPL-2.0-or-later.
Their URLs and source hashes are recorded in compatibility.json and
tests/fixtures/native-calendars.json and tests/fixtures/native-popup-layouts.json.
Automated fixture tests use simulated actors; real desktop validation is recorded
separately in VALIDATION.json.

